  "description": "DEPRECATED - use GroupDocs.Viewer.UI.SelfHost.Api instead.\n\n      GroupDocs.Viewer 26.8.0 ships per-TFM runtime packages that are cross-platform on\n      Windows, Linux and macOS, so GroupDocs.Viewer.UI.SelfHost.Api is cross-platform too\n      and this package has no reason to exist. Replace the reference with\n      GroupDocs.Viewer.UI.SelfHost.Api - the namespaces, the AddGroupDocsViewerSelfHostApi()\n      entry point and the configuration API are unchanged, so no code changes are needed.\n\n      This version contains no assemblies. It only forwards to GroupDocs.Viewer.UI.SelfHost.Api.",
